    "notes": "Safe Landing below in the valley bassin (and walk up across the a gully to the right on a path to the village of Idikel where retrieval from the Tafraout-Agadir road is easy!) or  below Fifilou  at the road before the high voltage lines.\r\nTOP-landing possible, but(very) tricky/ risky with thermal gusts!",
    "url": "https://www.paraglidingearth.com/?site=6821"
  },
